---
import Site from '../../layouts/Site.astro';
---

<Site
	title="Meatingplace: Rebuilding MTG's Highest-Traffic Site as a Responsive Product · Steven Vanden Heuvel"
	description="As Creative Director at MTG, I led the responsive rebuild of Meatingplace, the flagship daily news site for U.S. meat and poultry professionals and the largest audience in the portfolio."
>
	<section class="cs-hero">
		<div class="cs-hero__inner">
			<a class="cs-back-top" href="/#work">← Case studies</a>
			<p class="eyebrow">Case study</p>
			<h1 class="cs-hero__title display">Meatingplace: Rebuilding MTG's Highest-Traffic Site as a Responsive Product</h1>
			<p class="cs-hero__lede">MTG's flagship and largest audience was running on a 2007 build. The work was to rebuild it as a responsive product for a daily newsroom.</p>
			<dl class="cs-meta">
				<div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Creative Director</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Org</dt><dd>MTG Media Group</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Recognition</dt><dd>2018 Folio OZZIE Honorable Mention, Overall Art Direction</dd></div>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt section--figure">
		<div class="section__inner">
			<div class="cs-figure" data-animate="fade">
				<img class="theme-img theme-img--dark" src="/images/case-studies/meatingplace/meatingplace-hero.jpg" alt="Meatingplace responsive site on mobile and desktop" />
				<img class="theme-img theme-img--light" src="/images/case-studies/meatingplace/meatingplace-hero-light.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">What was unclear</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">The biggest audience, on a 2007 build.</p>
				<p>Meatingplace, MTG's flagship daily news site for U.S. meat and poultry professionals and the largest audience in the portfolio, was running on a 2007 build with a dated interface and no responsive experience.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">What I led</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">A modern, responsive product for a daily newsroom.</p>
				<p>I gave it a modern UI and UX as a responsive product: a daily-news information architecture and layouts built for current devices.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">Who I influenced</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">The redesign, across the business.</p>
				<p>I led the redesign, working with the owner and president, the finance president, the Content Director, the Publisher, the editors, and the developers.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">What changed</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">A finished, recognized rebuild that did not ship under MTG.</p>
			</div>
			<ul class="cs-awards">
				<li><span class="cs-awards__mark">★</span><span>2018 Folio OZZIE Honorable Mention, Overall Art Direction</span></li>
				<li><span class="cs-awards__mark">★</span><span>Modernization design-complete and approved for launch</span></li>
				<li><span class="cs-awards__mark">◆</span><span>MTG was acquired before launch, and new ownership pursued a separate redesign</span></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-back">
			<a class="btn" href="/work/alt-meat">← Alt-Meat</a>
			<a class="btn btn--primary" href="/#work">Back to all work</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</Site>

<style>
	.cs-hero { max-width: var(--max); margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--gutter); }
	.cs-back-top { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); color: var(--text-mute); font-size: var(--text-body-sm); }
	.cs-back-top:hover { color: var(--lime); }
	.cs-hero__title { margin: var(--space-xs) 0 var(--space-lg); max-width: 20ch; }
	.cs-hero__lede { font-size: var(--text-deck); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.5; max-width: 56ch; margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl); font-weight: 500; }
	.cs-meta { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: var(--space-md); margin: 0; padding: var(--space-lg) 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
	.cs-meta div { margin: 0; }
	.cs-meta dt { font-size: var(--text-label); letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-mute); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); }
	.cs-meta dd { margin: 0; color: var(--text); font-size: var(--text-body); font-weight: 500; }

	.cs-figure { max-width: 75%; margin: 0 auto; }
	.cs-figure img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

	.cs-body { display: grid; gap: var(--space-2xl); max-width: var(--max-narrow); }
	/* Hierarchy: eyebrow + subhead group as the headline, body is support. */
	.cs-block .eyebrow { margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); }
	.cs-block__lede { color: var(--text); font-size: clamp(24px, 2.5vw, 32px); font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg); letter-spacing: -0.015em; line-height: 1.25; }
	.cs-block p { color: #5A6565; margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; }
	.cs-block p + p { margin-top: var(--space-sm); }

	.cs-awards { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 0; }
	.cs-awards li { display: flex; gap: var(--space-md); align-items: center; padding: var(--space-md) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); font-size: 18px; }
	.cs-awards li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
	.cs-awards__mark { color: var(--lime); font-size: 22px; min-width: 24px; }

	.cs-back { display: flex; gap: var(--space-sm); flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }

	@media (max-width: 880px) {
		.section--figure { padding: 0 24px; }
		.cs-figure { max-width: 100%; }
		.cs-hero__title { font-size: clamp(32px, 9vw, 56px); }
	}
	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.cs-meta { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
	}
</style>
